\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 The House Judiciary Select Subcommittee on the Weaponization of the Federal Government issued the following testimony by Michael Shellenberger, author and co-founder of the Breakthrough Institute and the California Peace Coalition, involving a hearing on March 9, 2023, entitled "The Twitter Files":}
